  "title": "Solana Gas Sponsorship: ZeroDev Brings Seamless UX to the SVM",
  "summary": "Eliminate gas friction on Solana. Use ZeroDev’s Solana paymaster to sponsor transactions for Phantom, multisigs, and PDAs. Build for velocity and scale. ZeroDev’s Solana Gas Sponsorship allows Solana-based applications to sponsor transaction fees for users. It works across traditional wallets like Phantom, multisigs, and Program Derived Addresses (PDAs). By removing the requirement for users to hold SOL for gas, developers can eliminate onboarding friction and significantly improve user retention.",
